@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ContextLayer", "rootPath": "/workspace/ContextLayer" }

### 2. Index the files
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/index

### 3. Create the vectors (this is what fills pgvector)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/embeddings/refresh

### 4. Check how many are embedded
GET http://localhost:8080/api/projects/1/embeddings/status

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Register a project (use a real folder, e.g. this repo itself)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ContextLayer",
  "rootPath": "C:/Users/Asus/Desktop/ContextLayer",
  "description": "Indexing ourselves"
}

### List
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1

### Validation error demo (blank name)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "rootPath": "C:/x" }

### Index a project
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/index

### Stats
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/stats

### Git: sync history
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/sync

### Git: hot files / commits / co-change / uncommitted work
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/hot-files
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/recent-commits
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/co-changes?path=backend/pom.xml
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/git/working-changes

### Day 6-9: one-click refresh and overview
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/refresh?force=true
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/overview

### Day 10: keyword search
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/search?q=how does project creation validate the folder path
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/search?q=chunker overlap&limit=5

### Day 12: hybrid search
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/hybrid-search?q=how are ignored files and folders excluded when indexing

### Day 13: ranking
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/rank?task=Fix the problem where ignored folders still get indexed

### Day 14: budget
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/budget-preview?task=Fix the problem where ignored folders still get indexed&maxTokens=4000
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/budget-preview?task=Fix the problem where ignored folders still get indexed&maxTokens=12000&includeText=true

### Day 15: compression
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/compress-preview?path=backend/src/main/java/com/contextlayer/backend/indexing/IndexingService.java&q=incremental unchanged hash
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/budget-preview?task=Fix the problem where ignored folders still get indexed&maxTokens=6000&includeText=true

### Day 16: pack
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/pack
Content-Type: application/json

{ "task": "Fix the problem where ignored folders still get indexed", "maxTokens": 6000 }

### Day 16: markdown only
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/pack.md?task=How does token budgeting choose detail levels&maxTokens=5000

### Day 17: LLM
GET {{host}}/api/llm/status

### Local AI summaries for code files (slow on CPU: max 50 files per call)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/summaries/refresh?generator=llm

### Compare the local token count with the model's own (use maxTokens <= 4000)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/token-check?task=How does incremental indexing decide a file changed&maxTokens=3000

